+ * /usr/share/zoneinfo: the zone and link names from tzdata.zi, a zone's
+ * offset, daylight saving and abbreviation at an instant from its compiled
+ * TZif file, and past the file's last transition from the POSIX TZ rule the
+ * file ends with. Office (Word) asks for the list of zones as it starts.
